<title>UK: Eurofima sets 2.0 billion Lux franc 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Eurofima sets 2.0 billion Lux franc 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Credit Europeen, Banque Bruxelles Lambert SA and Banque Internationale a Luxembourg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROFIMA</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    14.NOV.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.0     PAY DATE 13/14.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   YIELD	 5.73</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    =	   SELL CONC  =	   PRAECIPUUM  0.175</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
